  "protocol": "On all38 actual float64 Krylov-driven capped states, independently evaluate a float32 Schur/Jacobian action and GMRES direction. No diagnostic float32 state affects the reference trajectory. Cast J,M,G and factor each bilateral component Hff in float32. Projection derivatives/active branches and local preconditioner inverses are computed from the original float64 state then cast; this deliberately isolates operator/Krylov precision and is not a complete float32 setup. GMRES remains restart32,4cycles,rtol1e-6,atol1e-12,hard160actions. Require original float64 unpreconditioned residual <=max(1e-12,1e-6*norm(F)). Also record random action normalized max error with1e-5screen. Preconditioner setup limitation must be reported. No precision/iteration tuning; retain every failure.\n",
  "sources": {
    "run.py": "from pathlib import Path\np=Path(__file__).resolve().parent\nsetup=(p.parent/'rain-continuation-krylov/audit.py').read_text().split(\"source=(p.parent/'rain-projected-continuation/run.py')\")[0]\nsetup=setup.replace(\"print('KRYLOV',records[-1],flush=True)\",\"print('KRYLOV',records[-1],flush=True);return x if passed else None\")\nexec(compile(setup,str(p/'operator64.py'),'exec'))\nJ32=m.J.astype(np.float32);M32=m.M.astype(np.float32);G32=m.G.astype(np.float32)\nfactors32=[(ii,cho_factor(r.Hff[np.ix_(ii,ii)].astype(np.float32),lower=True)) for ii,_ in factors]\ndef H32(x):return J32@(M32@(J32.T@x))+G32@x\ndef Schur32(v):\n x=np.zeros(m.offset,dtype=np.float32);x[r.remaining]=v;rhs=-H32(x)[r.free]\n for ii,f in factors32:x[r.free[ii]]=cho_solve(f,rhs[ii])\n return H32(x)[r.remaining]\njacsource=setup[setup.index('def jac_action('):setup.index('records=[]')]\njacsource=jacsource.replace('def jac_action(', 'def jac_action32(').replace('P=np.zeros((r.N,r.N))','P=np.zeros((r.N,r.N),dtype=np.float32)').replace('steps=np.zeros(r.N)','steps=np.zeros(r.N,dtype=np.float32)').replace('(1+lam)*v','np.float32(1+lam)*v').replace('Schur(v)','Schur32(v)')\nexec(compile(jacsource,str(p/'operator32.py'),'exec'))\naudit32=[];rng32=np.random.default_rng(20261008)\ndef check32(y,lam,F,D):\n action=jac_action32(y,lam);v=rng32.normal(size=r.N).astype(np.float32);want=D@v;actual=action(v);assert actual.dtype==np.float32\n control=float(max(abs(actual-want)/(1+abs(want))))\n local=[(np.array(ii),np.linalg.pinv(D[np.ix_(ii,ii)],rcond=1e-12).astype(np.float32)) for ii in pre_groups.values()]\n def pre(v):\n  out=np.zeros_like(v,dtype=np.float32)\n  for ii,inv in local:out[ii]=inv@v[ii]\n  return out\n count=0\n def mv(v):\n  nonlocal count\n  count+=1\n  if count>160:raise RuntimeError('action-cap')\n  return action(v)\n try:\n  x,info=gmres(LinearOperator((r.N,r.N),matvec=mv,dtype=np.float32),-F.astype(np.float32),M=LinearOperator((r.N,r.N),matvec=pre,dtype=np.float32),restart=32,maxiter=4,rtol=1e-6,atol=1e-12)\n  assert x.dtype==np.float32\n  residual=float(np.linalg.norm(D@x.astype(float)+F));passed=residual<=max(1e-12,1e-6*np.linalg.norm(F))\n except RuntimeError:info='action-cap';residual=None;passed=False\n audit32.append(dict(lam=lam,actions=count,info=info,original_absolute_residual=residual,rhs_norm=float(np.linalg.norm(F)),linear_pass=bool(passed),action_error=control,action_pass=control<=1e-5))\n print('FLOAT32',audit32[-1],flush=True)\nsource=(p.parent/'rain-projected-continuation/run.py').read_text().replace(\"for name,seed in [('cold',np.zeros(r.N)),('capped',m.old[r.remaining].copy())]:\",\"for name,seed in [('capped',m.old[r.remaining].copy())]:\")\nold=\"D=r.residual(y,True)+lam*r.E;delta,_,rank,_=np.linalg.lstsq(D,-F,rcond=1e-12);accepted=False\"\nnew=\"\"\"D=r.residual(y,True)+lam*r.E;delta=audit(y,lam,F,D);check32(y,lam,F,D);rank=-1;accepted=False\n   if delta is None:termination='linear-budget-failed';break\"\"\"\nassert old in source;source=source.replace(old,new).split(\"if not all(v['status']=='reference-pass'\")[0]\nexec(compile(source,str(p/'nonlinear64.py'),'exec'))\nresult=dict(systems=len(audit32),linear_failures=sum(not v['linear_pass'] for v in audit32),action_failures=sum(not v['action_pass'] for v in audit32),max_action_error=max(v['action_error'] for v in audit32),records=audit32)\n(p/'float32-audit.json').write_text(json.dumps(result,indent=2));print('SUMMARY',json.dumps({k:v for k,v in result.items() if k!='records'}),flush=True)\n"
  },
